      "message": "test(pick): pin the centre paths of points_pick::take, picks_text and pick_coords\n\nReview of PR #1405: four guards stayed green when broken. New pins:\n- ui centre_pick_tests: three points refuse a straight edge with nothing\n  drafted, draft a round edge as its centre, refuse a fourth point; an\n  axis by two points drafts a round edge and picks_text reads out its\n  centre's coordinates.\n- app centre_pick: pick_coords reports a round edge as its centre; the\n  three-points check names a straight edge before it counts the picks\n  (pins datum_of's centre_point call, which is reachable).\n\nRefs #692\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
